    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nON VIEW THURSDAY 1ST OF OCTOBER 5PM - 5:30PM\n\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present 19 Annamoe Park to the market. This beautifully presented three-bedroom family home occupies a superb position overlooking a mature green and benefits from a thoughtfully designed rear extension that significantly enhances the living accommodation. Bright, spacious and presented in turnkey condition throughout, the property offers a wonderful balance of flexible living and sleeping accommodation, including a ground-floor bedroom and shower room, making it ideal for families, downsizers or those seeking additional versatility. The home has been extensively upgraded in recent years with full redecoration throughout, a new boiler, hot water tank and heating controls, upgraded attic insulation, new flooring and carpets, new skylights. These improvements combine to create a bright, comfortable home that has been carefully maintained and upgraded over the years. Complemented by off-street parking to the front and a private rear garden, this is a superb opportunity to acquire a stylish and practical home in a well-established residential setting in the heart of Cabra.\n\nEntering the property, a welcoming hallway leads to a bright and spacious living room overlooking the green to the front. Beautifully presented with contemporary décor and a feature fireplace, this inviting room provides an ideal setting for relaxing and entertaining.\n\nTo the rear, the house opens into a bright kitchen and dining extension flooded with natural light from a rooflight overhead and French doors to the garden. The shaker-style kitchen is fitted with an excellent range of units and generous worktop space, while the dining area comfortably accommodates everyday family dining and social gatherings.\n\nThe ground-floor extension incorporates a versatile double bedroom together with a modern shower room. This flexible accommodation is ideal as a guest bedroom, home office, playroom or for those requiring ground-floor sleeping accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, there are two generous double bedrooms. The principal bedroom overlooks the green to the front and benefits from an attractive fireplace and built-in storage. The second bedroom enjoys the added benefit of an ensuite shower room, creating a comfortable and private retreat.\n\nTo the rear, the garden offers an excellent mix of patio and planted areas, providing a private outdoor space that is both low maintenance and practical for everyday enjoyment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWelcoming entrance hall providing access to the main living accommodation.\n\nLiving Room - 6.50m x 3.35m\nA bright and spacious reception room overlooking the green to the front. Beautifully presented with contemporary décor and a feature fireplace, creating a warm and inviting living space.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 3.35m x 3.55m\nA bright rear extension incorporating a shaker-style fitted kitchen and dining area. Rooflights and French doors flood the room with natural light and provide direct access to the rear garden.\n\nGround Floor Bedroom - 3.35m x 2.30m\nA versatile bedroom positioned within the rear extension, suitable for a variety of uses including guest accommodation, home office or family living.\n\nGround Floor Shower Room - 1.90m x 2.20m\nA modern shower room fitted with a walk-in shower, WC and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.35m x 4.30m\nA generous double bedroom overlooking the green to the front, featuring an attractive fireplace and built-in storage.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.10m x 3.15m\nA bright double bedroom with the added benefit of an ensuite shower room.\n\nEnsuite Shower Room - 2.15m x 1.05m\nFitted with shower enclosure, WC and wash hand basin.\n\nRear Garden - \nA private rear garden featuring a generous patio area together with mature planting, creating an ideal outdoor space for relaxation and entertaining.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
